// observability.proto — DashCenter northbound read-only telemetry API.
//
// This service is the "look but don't touch" half of the dashcenter.v1 surface.
// Every RPC here is non-mutating; clients use it to:
//
//   * watch per-DPU status (lifecycle, HA role, capacity, flow stats),
//   * query the flow table (per-DPU summary, optional per-flow list),
//   * inspect declared-vs-observed drift,
//   * pull consolidated counter reports,
//   * subscribe to the policy-change event stream,
//   * stream the immutable audit log.
//
// Streaming
// ---------
// GetDpuStatus, GetFlowList, WatchEvents, GetAuditLog are server-streaming.
// Long-lived watches use server-side keepalives (gRPC HTTP/2 PING) and clients
// MUST be prepared for re-subscription on transient disconnects.
//
// Read budget
// -----------
// dashd's HLD constrains read responses to a 500ms p99 budget for any single
// unary RPC. Streaming RPCs use chunked delivery and are not subject to the
// 500ms budget per chunk.

